ights and accelerating breakthroughs. Although more data are available than ever, only a fraction is being curated, integrated, understood, and analyzed. AI focuses on how computers learn from data and mimic human thought processes. AI increases learning capacity and provides decision support system at scales that are transforming the future of health care. This article is a review of applications for machine learning in health care with a focus on clinical, translational, and public health applications with an overview of the important role of privacy, data sharing, and genetic information.", "affiliation": "St. Jude Children's Research Hospital, Memphis, Tenn; University of Tennessee Health Science Center, Memphis.", "publicationStatus": "ppublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Print-Electronic", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't", "research-article", "Review", "Research Support, U.S. Gov't, Non-P.H.S.", "Journal Article", "Research Support, N.I.H., Extramural"]}, "grantsList": {"grant": [{"agency": "NHLBI NIH HHS", "acronym": "HL", "grantId": "R56 HL116832", "orderIn": 0}]}, "meshHeadingList": {"meshHeading": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Humans"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Forecasting"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Artificial Intelligence", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "TD", "qualifierName": "trends"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Decision Support Systems, Clinical", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "TD", "qualifierName": "trends"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Delivery of Health Care", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "MT", "qualifierName": "methods"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "abbreviation": "TD", "qualifierName": "trends"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Drug Discovery", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualif